# Go source is LF everywhere, including on Windows checkouts.
#
# gofmt treats a CRLF file as unformatted, so with core.autocrlf=true a Windows checkout
# fails `gofmt -l .` on every file in the module. Nothing local shows it: the files written
# here are already LF and git does not rewrite them until it checks them out again. CI on
# windows-latest checked out fresh and flagged all of them, which is the first thing that
# run found.
#
# Scoped to this directory rather than the repository root: the Node baseline's checkout
# behaviour is not this branch's to change.
*.go text eol=lf
# Embedded module bytes and PDF xref offsets must survive a Windows checkout.
internal/app/native-events.mjs text eol=lf
internal/app/testdata/*.pdf binary
